## 4️⃣ CI/CD 與部署

| 平台 | 步驟 | 參考 |
|------|------|------|
| **GitHub Actions** | `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` → `npm run build` → `vercel --prod` | [Vercel GitHub Action](https://github.com/vercel/vercel-action) |
| **Vercel** | 連結 GitHub → 自動部署 | [Vercel Docs](https://vercel.com/docs) |
| **Netlify** | 連結 GitHub → 自動部署 | [Netlify Docs](https://docs.netlify.com/) |
| **Render** | 連結 GitHub → 自動部署 | [Render Docs](https://render.com/docs) |

**範例 GitHub Actions**

```yaml
name: Deploy to Vercel

on:
  push:
    branches: [main]

jobs:
  build-and-deploy:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4
        with:
          node-version: '20'
      - run: npm ci
      - run: npm run build
      - uses: amondnet/vercel-action@v20
        with:
          vercel-token: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_TOKEN }}
          vercel-org-id: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_ORG_ID }}
          vercel-project-id: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_PROJECT_ID }}
          vercel-args: '--prod'
```

